 4 y)^{2}-(y)=4\\,⟹\\,u^{2}-v=4\\,⟹\\,v=u^{2} - 4.\n$$\n\nwhile substituting $y=v$ into the equation of the second curve, we obtain\n\n$$\nv=8.\n$$\n\nTo find the intersections of the curves in the $uv$-plane, we solve the following system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}v=u^{2} - 4 \\\\ v=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,⟹\\,u=\\pm 2 \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection points are $(\\pm 2 \\sqrt{3},8).$\n\nTherefore, our domain in the $uv$-plane has the type I representation\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,- 2 \\sqrt{3}\\le u\\le 2 \\sqrt{3},\\,u^{2} - 4\\le v\\le 8\\}.\n$$\n\n![](images/23/2369c3299b61f996c6203e1e45a7a62c74cf9e8f4691c2d0941bdeec0a5ae53c.png)\n\n**Step 2**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)} & =\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\frac{∂u}{∂x}&\\frac{∂u}{∂y}\\\\\\frac{∂v}{∂x}&\\frac{∂v}{∂y}\\end{matrix}\\right| \\\\ &=\\left|\\begin{matrix}1&-4\\\\0&1\\end{matrix}\\right| \\\\ &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}={(\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)})}^{-1}=(1)^{-1}=1.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$  In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 4**: Compute the required area.\n\nWe calculate the required area by performing the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_D dxdy &=\\iint_Δ |\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\,dudv \\\\ &=\\iint_Δ |1|\\,dudv \\\\ &=1\\int_{- 2 \\sqrt{3}}^{2 \\sqrt{3}}[\\int_{u^{2} - 4}^{8}dv]du \\\\ &=1\\int_{- 2 \\sqrt{3}}^{2 \\sqrt{3}}[v]_{u^{2} - 4}^{8}du \\\\ &=1\\int_{- 2 \\sqrt{3}}^{2 \\sqrt{3}}(8)-(u^{2} - 4)du \\\\ &=1\\int_{- 2 \\sqrt{3}}^{2 \\sqrt{3}}(12 - u^{2})du \\\\ &=1[- \\frac{u^{3}}{3} + 12 u]_{- 2 \\sqrt{3}}^{2 \\sqrt{3}} \\\\ &=1(((24 \\sqrt{3})+(- 8 \\sqrt{3}))-((- 24 \\sqrt{3})+(8 \\sqrt{3}))) \\\\ &=1(32 \\sqrt{3}) \\\\ &=32 \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536028 17592186045443 true] [17592186558927 1080 "\\frac{1000}{21}" 13194139536028 17592186045443 true] [17592186558927 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536028 17592186045443 true] [17592186558927 1083 #uuid "ffe1737a-a180-5975-ab3f-1947b931b375" 13194139536028 17592186045443 true] [17592186558928 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186129197.py" 13194139536028 17592186045443 true] [17592186558928 1169 #uuid "a6b8529c-da18-54ee-93d4-7fc40bcebd9b" 13194139536028 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"029b9230-f734-5a97-aaf8-332a97157ff1" 17592186558851 "04e022d6-9b4b-55e1-b7b6-ebb206669d3c" 17592186558852 "067912ba-31ed-5eca-bf1b-2e1a722add95" 17592186558853 "0c128895-028a-5333-bd5a-8ee667b07a6f" 17592186558854 "0d8e6678-6b99-5782-a45c-738ef21e7fe5" 17592186558855 "0ec47881-0e4e-5e03-9b0e-45477c45f447" 17592186558856 "127bf8cb-8d30-56a4-8bcf-c7895668bae8" 17592186558857 "1487794f-abfc-57b1-b6ae-51c4d2693ef9" 17592186558858 "190a0830-4b78-5385-b252-e2f158e62cb7" 17592186558859 "1ae34a70-04dd-51c4-956e-e0526d0f083b" 17592186558860 "1c77fe9a-3bb4-5a95-a9e4-ba4caec3f0b6" 17592186558861 "212837bb-d4a2-559b-b8ae-bdcf0fb8646e" 17592186558862 "24456fc9-3202-52e6-96c1-45748de19c53" 17592186558863 "24ba8bdc-8e30-56a6-ba09-574da792b447" 17592186558864 "26c782a3-117c-52e4-894f-257331d9e2f3" 17592186558865 "27d774f4-7aa1-53ef-bfff-e5c57da8b9db" 17592186558866 "282f49f3-c8a0-5ec9-9e26-240a0adb3e3f" 17592186558867 "29d96b47-2528-56e8-a582-384c42fdef27" 17592186558868 "2bc4fd0a-f557-541f-8f97-4db32a398437" 17592186558869 "3313f71a-a789-5b76-a642-c2288a3b5693" 17592186558870 "34aa0c62-866e-5716-bea9-13a164eb9cbf" 17592186558871 "3cef64cc-06fc-5d5e-88c6-7d1cbbc17e0e" 17592186558872 "3da452e4-4b6e-5d5a-925f-4095e4c4f3a9" 17592186558873 "3e60f5e8-67d9-5947-9c0b-02d3e2848b7c" 17592186558874 "479319fb-8a2c-5f38-a919-3a96a6d6d6c0" 17592186558875 "4bf81fa8-fdda-58ba-a730-3d93182c45ac" 17592186558876 "5760816a-e7c5-5515